WEBVTT

00:02.250 --> 00:04.020
Let's go to Rajima Volcano.

00:04.270 --> 00:05.020
What?

00:06.690 --> 00:08.320
If it will make me stronger...

00:08.320 --> 00:10.840
If it will allow me to drive back
the Lucasite in the temple...

00:11.320 --> 00:12.400
I will go.

00:14.150 --> 00:17.280
But you're injured.
There's something wrong with you.

00:17.400 --> 00:21.700
I guess we can't help it if we're going
to heal your wounds in the hot springs.

00:22.300 --> 00:26.990
Besides, I'd like to drink
water from this spring.

00:30.350 --> 00:35.010
Let's turn this place back into
the beautiful place it was.

00:35.340 --> 00:37.110
Let's do it for Kero-chan, too.

00:37.110 --> 00:37.930
Yeah.

00:41.050 --> 00:45.480
The grace of the stars heals the people.

00:46.350 --> 00:51.010
However, with excessive use it has decayed.

00:51.920 --> 00:55.780
One realizes their mistake.

00:56.680 --> 00:59.980
Filled with gratitude, they protect the stars.

02:24.560 --> 02:32.000
I'm Definitely Going to Take a Bath!

02:54.190 --> 02:56.610
I can't take this anymore!

03:02.720 --> 03:07.440
I'm tired, tired, tired, tired!

03:07.440 --> 03:09.850
You seem to have plenty of energy to me.

03:12.530 --> 03:16.090
In any case, I can't walk another step!

03:17.980 --> 03:21.180
Fine. Then let's camp here today.

03:22.620 --> 03:23.510
No.

03:23.510 --> 03:24.350
What?

03:24.350 --> 03:25.970
I don't want to camp out any more!

03:25.970 --> 03:27.600
I want to sleep in a proper bed!

03:27.970 --> 03:30.470
You can cry all you want,

03:30.470 --> 03:32.520
but we're not going to
find anything out here...

03:39.240 --> 03:40.130
Look.

03:41.140 --> 03:41.960
There's a house.

03:41.960 --> 03:42.700
What?

03:43.360 --> 03:44.550
Where?

03:48.950 --> 03:50.410
Yahoo!

03:55.010 --> 03:57.350
I thought she couldn't take another step.

04:07.940 --> 04:09.240
This is...

04:09.240 --> 04:11.020
It looks like an inn.

04:11.560 --> 04:14.030
That's even better, then.

04:20.570 --> 04:22.240
Welcome.

04:23.030 --> 04:25.360
Welcome to the Fire Spewing Mountain Inn.

04:26.570 --> 04:28.440
It's not a mirage.

04:28.440 --> 04:29.490
That's good.

04:30.190 --> 04:32.510
Landlady, we've got guests.

04:32.990 --> 04:34.280
Okay!

04:36.230 --> 04:40.080
Welcome. I am the landlady
of the Fire Spewing Mountain Inn.

04:40.080 --> 04:42.010
It's a pleasure to meet you.

04:42.560 --> 04:43.380
You're so cu—

04:43.380 --> 04:44.760
Don't call me cute!

04:56.420 --> 04:58.020
Have some tea.

04:58.020 --> 04:59.610
Thank you.

05:02.480 --> 05:04.340
Miss, are you here for the hot springs?

05:04.890 --> 05:06.230
Oh, yes.

05:06.570 --> 05:08.990
Our hot springs are very
good for curing wounds.

05:10.180 --> 05:12.080
Really? That's great.

05:12.440 --> 05:14.460
It will even make your skin silky smooth.

05:14.830 --> 05:16.460
What? Silky smooth?

05:19.960 --> 05:22.960
Bath, bath, bath.

05:19.960 --> 05:22.960
Silky, silky smooth.

05:36.550 --> 05:38.980
Hey, what's going on here?

05:38.980 --> 05:40.560
There isn't enough hot water.

05:40.870 --> 05:42.910
It's perfect for me.

05:42.910 --> 05:45.940
It might be just right for you,
but it's not nearly enough for us.

05:47.240 --> 05:49.660
I'm going to catch a cold.

05:50.130 --> 05:51.370
Oh, I know.

05:54.740 --> 05:58.580
Hot water, surround me and heal my body.

06:01.580 --> 06:04.090
Good work, water user.
Even though it's bath water.

06:04.570 --> 06:07.300
It feels so good...

06:13.580 --> 06:16.710
Amazing. It really is effective
for curing wounds.

06:19.250 --> 06:21.020
Levi-tan, no fair.

06:22.510 --> 06:23.830
I'm getting in!

06:25.500 --> 06:27.300
It's good for your skin, too!

06:28.620 --> 06:30.860
Your wound has mostly healed.

06:31.240 --> 06:33.050
Yes, I'm fine now.

06:34.770 --> 06:37.490
Maybe you shouldn't push yourself too hard.

06:41.410 --> 06:43.030
Nice and smooth.

06:43.030 --> 06:44.520
That felt good.

06:44.520 --> 06:45.520
Yeah.

06:51.990 --> 06:54.720
Dinner is served in the great hall, huh?

06:55.370 --> 06:58.060
I'm so excited to see what's for dinner.

06:58.580 --> 07:03.910
Don't places like this serve
special dishes that...

07:03.910 --> 07:05.650
...can only be found around here?

07:06.700 --> 07:10.200
Just thinking about the
food is making me drool.

07:10.200 --> 07:13.650
You have such poor manners.

07:13.650 --> 07:15.490
What? I can't help it.

07:18.320 --> 07:20.290
It looks delicious.

07:21.680 --> 07:26.300
I'm not happy with the way I'm
being treated here, either.

07:28.250 --> 07:30.100
It's delicious.

07:39.580 --> 07:42.790
Hello. I'm the ninja landlady.

07:42.790 --> 07:44.860
I'm the lizardman waitress.

07:47.250 --> 07:50.350
I've been having a bit of trouble lately.

07:50.350 --> 07:52.140
What's that, landlady?

07:52.140 --> 07:55.490
The hot springs haven't
been producing much water.

07:55.490 --> 07:58.340
Now, now. Don't let it get you down.

07:58.340 --> 07:59.950
I'm sure it will be fine.

08:00.570 --> 08:03.710
It'll be fine? Do you have a good idea?

08:04.190 --> 08:06.210
No, not really.

08:06.700 --> 08:10.160
Oh, you're just saying it'll be fine?

08:10.160 --> 08:13.530
Why wouldn't the water be
fine at a hot springs?

08:13.530 --> 08:16.720
I'm having trouble because
there isn't any water!

08:17.400 --> 08:19.950
It's time to solicit customers
at the base of the mountain.

08:19.950 --> 08:22.020
"Water" you waiting for? Take a dip.

08:24.560 --> 08:27.370
This has been a performance by
the Fire Spewing Mountain Inn girls.

08:38.610 --> 08:41.480
I wonder what that was about.

08:41.480 --> 08:46.830
Their lame jokes ruined the good
mood I was in from the hot springs.

08:51.450 --> 08:52.340
Oh?

08:54.090 --> 08:55.720
Our beds are already laid out.

08:57.100 --> 09:00.160
Beds!

09:00.160 --> 09:01.350
Hooray!

09:03.810 --> 09:06.230
They're so soft.

09:07.330 --> 09:09.700
She must really hate camping.

09:09.700 --> 09:11.400
Excuse me.

09:13.980 --> 09:17.320
Would you like a massage?

09:17.600 --> 09:19.150
A massage?

09:30.950 --> 09:33.740
You're quite stiff.

09:33.740 --> 09:35.170
I know.

09:35.450 --> 09:39.740
I've been walking so much lately,
my legs are as hard as rocks.

09:40.680 --> 09:45.140
Beds are the best!
Massages are the best!

10:03.800 --> 10:05.120
You can't sleep?

10:05.700 --> 10:06.710
Not really.

10:07.710 --> 10:11.160
I was just wondering if my
dads are worried about me.

10:11.990 --> 10:14.050
And my sisters, too.

10:14.700 --> 10:15.710
I see.

10:16.580 --> 10:20.970
Your family would be worried
if you suddenly disappeared.

10:26.460 --> 10:28.290
We went from the ocean to the desert...

10:28.910 --> 10:32.100
And now we're at a volcano.

10:35.090 --> 10:39.150
We've come pretty far.

10:39.620 --> 10:42.480
I'm sorry. It's my fault.

10:44.950 --> 10:47.550
You seem to have forgotten, so I'll tell you.

10:48.290 --> 10:51.320
This is the continuation of my vacation.

10:52.680 --> 10:55.880
It's still called vacation until you go home.

10:55.880 --> 10:58.800
You don't have to worry about anything else.

11:13.870 --> 11:18.050
It looks like your arm has healed completely.

11:19.980 --> 11:21.280
Yes.

11:21.690 --> 11:24.900
Between the hot springs and
massage, I feel refreshed.

11:25.560 --> 11:29.290
Let's head to Rajima Volcano
after we eat breakfast.

11:29.670 --> 11:31.290
Yeah!

11:33.660 --> 11:37.500
This is the bill for your stay.

11:38.680 --> 11:40.610
It's pretty expensive.

11:41.110 --> 11:44.640
Yes, well, you did enjoy plenty of services.

11:45.560 --> 11:48.110
The hot springs, show, and massage.

11:48.110 --> 11:50.540
We only owe this much after
enjoying the total package.

11:50.540 --> 11:51.900
It's cheap.

11:51.900 --> 11:53.520
Thanks for paying, Mu-chan.

11:53.850 --> 11:56.570
Yes, we reduced the price for you.

11:57.190 --> 11:59.010
What? It's missing.

11:59.010 --> 12:00.590
My wallet is missing!

12:00.590 --> 12:02.240
Your wallet is missing?

12:02.240 --> 12:04.430
How are we going to pay for this, then?

12:04.430 --> 12:06.580
Did you drop it somewhere?

12:07.300 --> 12:09.930
Look harder.

12:09.930 --> 12:11.580
Miss...

12:11.980 --> 12:15.580
Are you saying you can't pay?

12:15.840 --> 12:17.500
Well...

12:17.500 --> 12:19.050
Not that we don't want to...

12:19.340 --> 12:20.610
In that case...

12:20.610 --> 12:22.590
You'll work off your debt!

12:23.040 --> 12:26.600
What? Work?!

14:06.690 --> 14:08.230
I'm exhausted.

14:08.230 --> 14:10.660
I can't move.

14:10.990 --> 14:14.290
Sorry for making you do
work you're not used to.

14:14.910 --> 14:18.540
Dinner's ready.
Why don't you eat with us?

14:18.760 --> 14:19.550
What?

14:20.010 --> 14:21.540
Yes, please!

14:21.990 --> 14:23.500
Eat up.

14:26.790 --> 14:30.600
It's the Fire Spewing Mountain Inn's
specialty, Volcano Curry.

14:31.350 --> 14:33.350
Thanks for the food!

14:37.900 --> 14:40.420
It's so spicy!

14:40.420 --> 14:42.070
But it's delicious!

14:42.520 --> 14:45.250
Spicy, delicious! Spicy, delicious!

14:52.710 --> 14:54.280
It's delicious!

14:54.730 --> 14:57.630
It looks like you like our Volcano Curry.

14:59.190 --> 15:02.470
For generations, landladies
of the Fire Spewing Mountain Inn...

15:02.470 --> 15:06.800
...have been simmering and
adding to this curry.

15:06.800 --> 15:08.170
I see.

15:08.170 --> 15:10.800
The flavor's been passed
down for generations, then.

15:11.370 --> 15:14.050
But even that may be coming to an end.

15:15.940 --> 15:19.730
I'm sure you noticed when you
entered the hot springs.

15:20.520 --> 15:23.730
The amount of hot water
has been decreasing,

15:23.730 --> 15:26.810
and we've been losing
business because of it.

15:27.440 --> 15:31.570
At this rate, this place will
have to close down soon.

15:32.560 --> 15:36.020
Ever since her parents
died a few years ago,

15:36.020 --> 15:38.580
the landlady has been
doing everything she can...

15:38.580 --> 15:40.340
...to protect the Fire Spewing Mountain Inn.

15:41.650 --> 15:44.820
Doing everything she can
to protect the inn...

15:54.480 --> 16:00.170
For the landlady, this place is
full of memories with her parents.

16:02.390 --> 16:07.110
If the hot springs would return
to normal, it might work out.

16:07.880 --> 16:09.700
But at this rate...

16:13.820 --> 16:15.570
It might work out.

16:15.810 --> 16:16.710
What?

16:16.710 --> 16:18.250
Is that true, pet?

16:18.250 --> 16:21.080
I'm not a pet! I'm Syrop the fairy!

16:21.520 --> 16:25.570
Syrop, is there really a way
to restore the hot springs?

16:25.570 --> 16:29.090
Well, it's not certain, but...

16:29.610 --> 16:34.920
This generally occurs when the power
of the master of the volcano weakens.

16:34.920 --> 16:36.390
The master of the volcano?

16:37.590 --> 16:41.840
You mean someone like
Yurlulun of the swamp?

16:41.840 --> 16:43.700
It's Yurlungur!

16:43.700 --> 16:46.520
You got the name wrong,
but yes, someone like that.

16:47.070 --> 16:51.450
What should we do to make the hot
springs produce water like they used to?

16:53.060 --> 16:57.280
Well, we'd have to go to the volcano and
meet the master to know for sure...

16:57.710 --> 16:59.280
Let's go to meet him, then.

16:59.650 --> 17:01.950
What? Isn't the master of the volcano...

17:01.950 --> 17:04.540
...something like that big
one from the swamp?

17:05.860 --> 17:08.460
How do we know we won't
be swallowed again?

17:22.340 --> 17:26.390
Going to the volcano was our
goal in the first place.

17:26.390 --> 17:28.080
We've got to go.

17:28.080 --> 17:28.790
Yeah.

17:29.690 --> 17:31.190
Hold on!

17:31.490 --> 17:36.200
We're working off our debt right now, right?

17:36.550 --> 17:40.200
We can't just leave without permission...

17:40.200 --> 17:41.700
Don't worry about that.

17:42.280 --> 17:45.960
If you're leaving to restore the hot springs,

17:46.390 --> 17:49.710
I'll explain everything to the landlady.

17:49.710 --> 17:52.260
R-Really?

17:53.620 --> 17:55.720
Fine, fine, I get it!

17:55.720 --> 17:57.220
I'll go to the volcano, too!

17:57.710 --> 17:59.880
We have to go see this master
of the volcano, right?

18:14.720 --> 18:16.380
We're off.

18:17.580 --> 18:19.240
Be careful.

18:19.650 --> 18:20.930
Also, take this.

18:22.530 --> 18:25.440
It's Volcano Curry. You can eat it for lunch.

20:11.620 --> 20:19.380
Next Episode

20:14.540 --> 20:19.380
I'll Definitely Cheer You Up!
